    "use": "GET /v2/messages/{sourceDomainId}?transactionHash=0x... returns the message and attestation for a burn (poll until status complete), then pass both to MessageTransmitterV2.receiveMessage on the destination. Also GET /v2/burn/USDC/fees/{sourceDomainId}/{destDomainId} (fees for maxFee), GET /v2/fastBurn/USDC/allowance (Fast Transfer allowance), POST /v2/quote/burn/usdc/{sourceDomainId}/{destDomainId} (fee quote), POST /v2/reattest/{nonce}, GET /v2/publicKeys; legacy GET /v1/attestations/{messageHash} and /v1/messages/{sourceDomainId}/{transactionHash}. Rate limit 40 requests/second; exceeding it blocks all requests for 5 minutes (HTTP 429).",
