    "use": "Read-only: given inputCollectibleUsername(username) or inputCollectiblePhone(phone), returns fragment.collectibleInfo (purchase_date, currency, amount, crypto_currency, crypto_amount, url to the Fragment page). Requires a logged-in Telegram user session (MTProto); bots cannot call it. Not a simple REST key.",
    "source": "https://core.telegram.org/api/fragment"
